+# Meeting Record
+
+- Lakeside Literacy Network held its board meeting on 2026-09-17.
+- The meeting was called to order at 18:00 and adjourned at 19:42.
+- The meeting took place in Community Room B at Mercer Library.
+- Amara Cole, Chair, presided; Marcus Lee, Secretary, recorded the meeting.
+- Attendance: 6 present and 2 absent — Present in person: Amara Cole, Sofia Reyes, Marcus Lee, and Devon Brooks; Present remotely: Elena Park and Noah Kim; Absent excused: Lila Grant; Absent: Ivy Chen.
+
+# Decisions
+
+1. D-01 — Adopt the FY2027 literacy program calendar as circulated. Moved by Sofia Reyes; seconded by Devon Brooks. Vote: 6-0-0.
+2. D-02 — Hold the fall tutor orientation on 2026-10-24 at Mercer Library. Moved by Noah Kim; seconded by Elena Park. Vote: 5-0-1; Marcus Lee abstained.
+3. D-03 — Approve the updated records retention schedule effective 2026-10-01. Moved by Elena Park; seconded by Marcus Lee. Vote: 6-0-0.
